  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of solar and storage solution in Ukraine (Release and Standard Solar PV Solutions)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norad provides financial support for the development of mobile and stationary solar pv power generation and power storage solutions in Ukraine. The agreement is under Norad&apos;s Enterprise for Development Scheme (EDFJ).

Norad&apos;s support covers construction site preparations, logistics, infrastructure costs (high voltage upgrades) and legal costs. This is expected to help achieve the necessary permits for at least three solar projects by 31 December 2025.</narrative>
  </description>
